Otogi: Myth of Demons — technical preview v0.1
==============================================

This repository contains a static recompilation of the original Xbox release of
*Otogi: Myth of Demons*. It ships no game data.

Game content
------------
*Otogi: Myth of Demons* and all of its assets, code, names, and marks are
copyright FromSoftware, Inc. and Sega Corporation. No game data, disc image,
XBE, extracted asset, or generated recompiled source is distributed here. You
must supply your own legally obtained copy of the game; `game/` and
`src/game/recomp/gen/` are gitignored for that reason.

Runtime toolkit
---------------
The executable is built against the `xboxrecomp` toolkit
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/xboxrecomp), which is MIT-licensed. This project
carries the toolkit changes it needs as `xboxrecomp-linux.patch`, which applies
to upstream tag `v0.15.0`. The toolkit's own `LICENSE` and `NOTICE` govern that
code.

Third-party libraries
---------------------
- SDL2 — zlib license
- libepoxy — MIT license
- CMake, Ninja, and the C toolchain are build-time dependencies and are not
  distributed here.

No warranty
-----------
This is an unfinished technical preview provided as-is, without warranty of any
kind. It does not render a picture and does not accept controller input.
